Small Abomination, Wailing Evil
Armor Class 13 (Frosted Wings)Hit Points 22 (4d6 + 8)Speed 10 ft., fly 30 ft.
STR,DEX,CON,INT,WIS,CHA
8 (-1),16 (+3),14 (+2),6 (-2),10 (+0),7 (-2)
Damage Vulnerabilities RadiantDamage Immunities ColdCondition Immunities CursedSenses Passive Perception 10Challenge 1 (200 XP)
Traits:
Crackling Flight: Unlike its lesser cousins, the Hoarfrost-Yowler does not suffer the Clumsy Flier penalty. However, its stiff, frozen wings emit a loud, crackling sound, granting disadvantage on its Dexterity (Stealth) checks while flying.
Actions:
Frost-Bite: Melee Weapon Attack: +5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) piercing damage plus 3 (1d6) cold damage.
Freezing Screech (Recharge 5-6): The Yowler emits a piercing, hyper-chilled screech infused with draconic sonic fury. Each creature within a 30-foot cone must succeed on a DC 12 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 10 (3d6) thunder damage and 10 (3d6) cold damage, and the ambient moisture around them flash-freezes, instantly plunging the temperature of any survival padding they wear to absolute zero and inflicting the "Frozen" state. On a success, the creature takes half damage and avoids the Frozen state.


