Necrotic Frost Pump: As a bonus action against a creature it is grappling, the Slush-Slurper pumps freezing necrotic sludge directly into the victim's garments. The target takes 7 (2d6) cold damage and 7 (2d6) necrotic damage, and their survival diaper immediately enters the debilitating, rigid "Frozen" state, reducing their speed by 10 feet and imposing disadvantage on Stealth checks even if they escape the grapple.


