Obsidian Hooves: Melee Weapon Attack: +9 to hit, reach 5 ft., one prone target. Hit: 17 (2d10 + 6) bludgeoning damage.
Trigger Rockslide (Recharge 5-6): The Avalanche-Horn slams its massive shadow-glass horns into the mountainside. Every creature on the ground within a 30-foot cone originating from the beast must make a DC 16 Dexterity saving throw, taking 28 (8d6) bludgeoning damage on a failed save and being restrained by the falling scree, or half as much damage on a successful one.

